{{dlc|nr}}[[file:Double Locked Room.png]] {{dlc|r}}[[File:Vault door locked.png]][[File:Vault door.png]]

'''Vaults'''  are [[special room]]s that contain a variety of [[pickups]]/[[chests]] (or occasional lack thereof). Vaults require two {{e|Key|text=keys}} to be opened, unlike most other special rooms. For a Vault to spawn, the following has to happen.
* {{dlc|nr}} An {{r|Arcade}} has to be able to spawn that floor. This requires that both:
** Isaac is holding five or more {{e|Penny|text=pennies}}
** The floor Isaac is going to is the second floor of a [[chapter]]
* {{dlc|nr}} Once the game determines an Arcade will spawn, a Vault has a 1/10 chance to replace that Arcade. [[Level Generation|This chance increases to 4/10 if Isaac has two or more keys.]]
* {{dlc+|r}} The floor Isaac is going to is the second floor of a [[chapter]] or the first floor of an alternate chapter ( {{S|Downpour}},  {{S|Dross}},  {{S|Mines}},  {{S|Ashpit}},  {{S|Mausoleum}},  {{S|Gehenna}} and  {{S|Corpse}}) {{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|r}} If Isaac has 2 or more keys, a Vault has a 1/3 chance to spawn. [[Level Generation|This chance increases to 4/10 if Isaac has five or more pennies, and will replace the Arcade.]]

